<title>USA: Del Global Tech says Q2 Feb 1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Del Global Tech says Q2 Feb 1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>VALHALLA, N.Y. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Del Global Technologies Corp Monday said sales for the second quarter ended February 1, 1997 was approximately $12.6 million compared to about $9.3 million for last year's second quarter.</p>
<p>Sales for the six month period ended February 1, 1997 was approximately $24.9 million compared to approximately $16.8 million for last year's comparable period, the company said.</p>
